  "id": "s007",
  "verdict": "suspect",
  "intended": "pred used[u: Unit] { (some v: Unit | v != u and cites[v, u]) or (some p: Pointer | p->u in Name.pointer) or (some g: Tag | g->u in Name.tag) }",
  "slip": "missing-condition",
  "why": "The rationale says a unit is used when something relies on it, and the canon counts both nesting and 'Derives from:' as ways a unit follows from another; the formula only counts nesting. A unit that another unit derives from, with nothing sitting in it and no pointer or tag naming it, is unused by the formula although that other unit relies on it."
